      "guid": null,
      "name": "Fontaine's Always Level Endurance (ALE)",
      "slug": "fontaines-always-level-endurance-ale",
      "teaser": "Let's you level Endurance skill while overweight.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/937.jpg",
      "downloads": 93872,
      "favourites_count": 3,
      "description": "<h3><strong>Always Level Endurance</strong></h3>\n<p>Let’s you level Endurance skill while overweight. That’s it. Nothing more, nothing less.</p>\n<p>By default you gain half as much Endurance XP while overweight, this can be changed with the in-game config (press F12, change multiplier, click outside menu, restart).</p>\n<p>To install, simply put the .dll file into your BepInEx/Plugins folder.</p>\n<p>This is already included in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Realism Mod</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: THIS IS ALREADY INCLUDED IN SPT REALISM MOD. DO NOT INSTALL BOTH!</strong></p>\n<p>If you wish to support me and my work you can <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Fontaine365\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">become a member on Patreon!</a>.</strong></p>\n",
